Image3" class="sc-bVHBsO cFdcpI pf-147_ pf-image-1"/></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:8;--c-md:9;--c-lg:9"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-iapVNj iUcVvL pf-148_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-kAkozD kgiAhT pf-149_ pf-heading-5-h3">Bulk Road Salt</h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-kAkozD kgiAhT pf-151_ pf-heading-7-h3">Tons of Quality Salt at a Competitive Price</h3><p class="sc-gFVuLS jpmtwg pf-153_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Rock Salt</b> - Works well down to 5˚F. This is one of the most popular ice melt options. Rock salt is used on highways, sidewalks, driveways, parking lots &amp; more, and it doesn't chemically break down concrete.
<br><b><br>Treated</b> - Works well down to -20˚F. Standard rock salt is treated with a proprietary blend of Calcium + Performance Enhancer with Corrosion Inhibitor that combines to increase melting power.
<br>   &nbsp; &nbsp; • Reduced Bounce and Scatter
<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; • Won’t Go Bad or Smell Over Time
<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; • Reduced Hardening During Storage
<br><br><b>Blended</b> - Works well down to -16˚F. A 50/50 blend of our Standard and Treated Rock Salts provides an economical solution to ice melting during very cold temps.
<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; • Cost-Efficient
<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; • Increased Melting Performance<br><br><br>Loose, unwrapped material sold by the truckload (20-22 tons).&nbsp;All bulk road salt orders are delivered from our multi-acre Lemont Salt Pile to your yard.</p></div></div></div><div class="sc-dhKdPU hjOBND pf-155_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-iapVNj iUcVvL pf-156_"><p class="sc-gFVuLS jpmtwg pf-157_ pf-text-4" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><a href="#top" target="_self"><span><span style="color: rgb(128, 128, 128);">Back to the Top ^</span></span></a></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-5bb9" data-pf-type="Section" id="bulk.liquid" class="sc-knuQPt cVHHwo pf-159_ pf-color-scheme-1 pf-bg-lazy"><div style="--cw:1400px" class="sc-kRRxPL eBhmAi"><div class="sc-dhKdPU hjOBND pf-160_ pf-bg-lazy pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-sm:7.5px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:4;--c-md:3;--c-lg:3"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-iapVNj iUcVvL pf-161_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/liquid-deicer_305x.jpg?v=1685731476" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/liquid-deicer.jpg?v=1685731476 1536w" width="600" height="600" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-bVHBsO cFdcpI pf-162_ pf-image-1"/></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:8;--c-md:9;--c-lg:9"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-iapVNj iUcVvL pf-163_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-kAkozD kgiAhT pf-164_ pf-heading-5-h3">Liquid&nbsp;De-Icer</h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-kAkozD kgiAhT pf-166_ pf-heading-7-h3">Starts Working Almost Instantly</h3><p class="sc-gFVuLS jpmtwg pf-168_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Remains effective for longer than many solid ice melt materials, and has a more precise and efficient application process.
<br><br><b>More Profitable</b>
<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; • Reduced Equipment Wear - Less Plowing Needed
<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; • Precise Application Rates - Fewer Applications
<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; • Increased Efficiency - Reduced Labor
<br><br><b>More Effective</b>
<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; • Russo Liquid Power Melt® Works down to -20°F
<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; •&nbsp;Pre-Application Delays/Prevents Ice
<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; • Application Rate: 40+ Gallons Per Acre*
<br><br><br>Available for purchase by the Gallon, in 265 Gallon Totes, or by the Truckload. Pickup in-store or schedule delivery.</p><p class="sc-gFVuLS jpmtwg pf-170_ pf-text-5" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">*Effectiveness is based on the correct application rate based upon weather conditions and the type of surface receiving application.</p></div></div></div><div class="sc-dhKdPU hjOBND pf-172_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-iapVNj iUcVvL pf-173_"><p class="sc-gFVuLS jpmtwg pf-174_ pf-text-4" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><a href="#top" target="_self"><span><span style="color: rgb(128, 128, 128);">Back to the Top ^</span></span></a></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-7b37" data-pf-type="Section" id="packaged.deicer" class="sc-knuQPt cVHHwo pf-176_ pf-color-scheme-1 pf-bg-lazy"><div style="--cw:1400px" class="sc-kRRxPL eBhmAi"><div class="sc-dhKdPU hjOBND pf-177_ pf-bg-lazy pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-sm:7.5px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:4;--c-md:3;--c-lg:3"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-iapVNj iUcVvL pf-178_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/bagged-salt-trio_305x.png?v=1685731476" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/bagged-salt-trio.png?v=1685731476 1536w" width="600" height="600" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-bVHBsO cFdcpI pf-179_ pf-image-1"/></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:8;--c-md:9;--c-lg:9"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-iapVNj iUcVvL pf-180_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-kAkozD kgiAhT pf-181_ pf-heading-5-h3">Packaged De-Icer</h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-kAkozD kgiAhT pf-183_ pf-heading-7-h3">A Solution for Every Application</h3><p class="sc-gFVuLS jpmtwg pf-185_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">We offer a wide variety of de-icing materials in a vast number of sizes to suit your professional snow and ice management needs.
<br><br><b>Sodium Chloride (NaCl)</b> - Effective down to 5°F, most popular and most commonly used on highways
<br><br><b>Magnesium Chloride (MgCl2)</b> - Effective down to -15°F, considered "environmentally friendly"
<br><br><b>Calcium Chloride (CaCl2)</b> - Effective down to -25°F, recognized as the "fast-acting, premium de-icer"
<br><br><b>Potassium Chloride (KCl)</b> - Effective down to -15°F, works slowly but is one of the more environmentally friendly options
<br><br><b>Acetates</b> - Most commonly used on structural concrete, parking garages, and airports where chlorides are banned
<br><br><b>Water Softener Salt</b> - Used as a rock salt alternative, it's extremely safe for humans and pets
<br><br><b>Others</b> - There is a plethora of other compound products, but they only represent a very small portion of the market. Urea, ammonium sulfate, glycols, and formates are the most common. Additionally, there are a variety of options available that combine the different chemicals together as a powerful de-icing product.<br><br><br>Available for purchase by the bag, skid (49-55 bags per pallet), or truckload.&nbsp;Pickup in-store or schedule delivery.<br></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-dhKdPU hjOBND pf-187_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-iapVNj iUcVvL pf-188_"><p class="sc-gFVuLS jpmtwg pf-189_ pf-text-4" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><a href="#top" target="_self"><span><span style="color: rgb(128, 128, 128);">Back to the Top ^</span></span></a></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-05d9" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-knuQPt cVHHwo pf-191_ pf-color-scheme-1"><div style="--cw:1400px" class="sc-kRRxPL eBhmAi"><div class="sc-dhKdPU hjOBND pf-192_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-iapVNj iUcVvL pf-193_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-kAkozD kgiAhT pf-194_ pf-heading-6-h3">Looking for More Winter Supplies?</h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-kAkozD kgiAhT pf-196_ pf-heading-4-h3">Find everything you need, from Plow Parts to Shovels!</h3><a href="/collections/winter-goods" target="_self" data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-bBeLha dmngPZ pf-198_ pf-button-2">Shop Winter Supplies &amp; Equipment</a><a href="/collections/parts" target="_self" data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-bBeLha dmngPZ pf-200_ pf-button-2">Shop Parts</a></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-d9d5" data-pf-type="Section" id="request.quote.order" class="sc-knuQPt cVHHwo pf-202_ pf-color-scheme-1"><div style=